AIM:Write a program to demonstrate list and related functions in python

CODE:
n=[1,5,8,9,7,2,4,3]
print("Original list:",n)
print("Length of list:",len(n))
n.append(6)
print("List after append:",n)
n.insert(2,10)
print("List after insertion:",n)
n.remove(9)
print("List after remove:",n)
n.pop()
print("List after pop:",n)
n.sort()
print("Sorted list:",n)
n.reverse()
print("Reversed list:",n)
a=n.copy()
print("Copied list:",a)
n.extend([20,30])
print("Extended list:",n)
print("Maximum value:",max(n))
print("Minimum value:",min(n))

